# =============================================================================
# QR & Barcode Generator Suite - Project-Specific .gitignore
# Purpose: Ensures internal research, AI memory, prompts, and draft notes are
# never committed to Git or published to the Hostinger live production web server.
# =============================================================================

# 1. Internal Architecture & Planning Documentation (Private to developer/AI)
*.md
!README.md
!llms.txt
!llms-full.txt
docs/

# 2. AI Prompts & Project Memory Logs
*_PROMPT.md
PROJECT_MEMORY.md
10_MASTER_INITIATION_PROMPT.md

# 3. Spreadsheets & Raw Research Data
*.xlsx
*.csv
*.zip
research data/
google indexing report/

# 4. Environment & Secrets (if any local tooling uses env files)
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# 5. Dependency Directories & Package Caches
node_modules/
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
pnpm-lock.yaml

# 6. Local Scratch, Temporary, & Log Files
dist/
scratch/
temp/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*

# 7. OS & IDE Generated Metadata
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
